  "claim": "Mazda is the manufacturer of the car used as design inspiration for the platform, the underpinnings of which are shared by both the this automobile and Mazda. Ohio Assembly produced this automobile until 2005.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Ford CD2 platform. Sentence: The design is based on Mazda's GF platform, used by the Mazda Capella/626.\nPage: Mazda Capella. Sentence: The Mazda Capella is a mid-size car that was manufactured by Mazda from 1970 to 2002.\nPage: Ford Escape. Sentence: Although the Escape and Tribute share the same underpinnings constructed from the Ford CD2 platform (based on Mazda GF underpinnings), the only panels common to the two vehicles are the roof and floor pressings.\nPage: Ohio Assembly. Sentence: It produced the Mercury Villager and Nissan Quest from 1993 through 2002, and the Ford Escape and Mercury Mariner until 2005.",
